<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Afprint yr-end profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Afprint yr-end profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year result for textile group Afprint to end-December 1996. (in million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	   1995</p>
<p> Turnover			 4,200  vs 4,300</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	 165  vs   164</p>
<p> Taxation			     5  vs    15</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	  160  vs   149</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
